WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.167
Okay,

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:09.867
a picture puzzle!

00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:13.267
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:13.833
A.

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:14.400
Top-right,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:14.967
B.

00:00:14.967 --> 00:00:15.533
Bottom-left,

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:16.100
C.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:16.667
Center,

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:17.833
or D.

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:18.400
Top-left?

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.533
Five seconds!

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.500
TIME'S UP!

00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:28.800
The answer is...

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.367
A,

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:29.900
top-right!

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.100
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.733
corner to corner:

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:34.300
top-left,

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:34.833
bottom-left,

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:35.400
bottom-right,

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.700
so the next corner is top-right.

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:40.233
So,

00:00:40.233 --> 00:00:42.267
are you smart or fart?

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:44.700
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.900
find your rank!

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:47.400
So,

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.800
how did you do?

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.167
Comment your score below,

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:51.533
and follow for more!
